1
00:00:00,725 --> 00:00:02,425
Wow, that's amazing!

2
00:00:02,426 --> 00:00:04,496
(Leonard:)I'm in a pretty great mood
today myself.

3
00:00:04,495 --> 00:00:07,495
(Sheldon:)Okay. Guess we're gonna
talk about you now.

4
00:00:07,498 --> 00:00:10,398
(Leonard:)Well, we are, because
Dr. Gallo made me realize

5
00:00:10,401 --> 00:00:13,171
(Leonard:)that I'm a worthwhile person
and that my feelings matter.

6
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:17,170
(Raj:)I learned that for free from
a cat poster, but good for you.

7
00:00:19,310 --> 00:00:20,580
(Sheldon:)Okay, back to me.

8
00:00:20,578 --> 00:00:23,478
(Sheldon:)I discovered an asteroid,
and now I get to name it.

9
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:25,181
(Raj:)Wait, what happened to us?

10
00:00:25,182 --> 00:00:26,412
(Sheldon:)Now, this isn't about us,

11
00:00:26,417 --> 00:00:28,587
(Sheldon:)this is about what's best
for the asteroid.

12
00:00:30,121 --> 00:00:32,051
(Leonard:)What are you thinking
of naming it?

13
00:00:32,056 --> 00:00:33,756
(Sheldon:)I haven't settled
on anything yet.

14
00:00:33,758 --> 00:00:35,588
We haven't settled
on anything yet.

15
00:00:35,593 --> 00:00:39,133
(Sheldon:)All right, way to go,
Cat Poster. You hang in there.

16
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:41,660
(Leonard:)You know what'd be nice?
Name it after your girlfriends.

17
00:00:41,665 --> 00:00:43,235
(Leonard:)Show them how much you care.

18
00:00:43,234 --> 00:00:45,634
(Raj:)That is a great idea.

19
00:00:45,636 --> 00:00:46,936
(Sheldon:)It's perfect.

20
00:00:46,937 --> 00:00:49,237
(Sheldon:)It appears romantic,
but it's really just

21
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,510
(Sheldon:)a rock in space that gets me

22
00:00:50,508 --> 00:00:52,038
(Sheldon:)out of Valentine's Day
forever.

23
00:00:54,378 --> 00:00:56,878
(Raj:)So, uh, what were you thinking?
Combine their names?

24
00:00:56,881 --> 00:00:58,181
(Sheldon:)I like it.

